      <h1>Inverted Pendulum: System Analysis</h1>
      <!--introduction-->
      <p>Key MATLAB commands used in this tutorial are: <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/tf.html"><tt>tf</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/ss.html"><tt>ss</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/zpkdata.html"><tt>zpkdata</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/impulse.html"><tt>impulse</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/lsim.html"><tt>lsim</tt></a></p>
      </div>
	<div class="related_links">
      <h3>Related Tutorial Links</h3>
